Package: vayuayan
Type: Package
Title: Air Quality Data from Indian Monitoring Networks and Satellites
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", , "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Mahesh Kumar", "Prajapat", , "22b0433@iitb.ac.in", role = "aut"),
    person("Darakhshan", "Nehal", , "darakhshannehal@gmail.com", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Downloads and examines air quality data for India: monitoring
    stations of the Central Pollution Control Board (CPCB) and the Delhi
    Pollution Control Committee (DPCC), low-cost sensors collected by Open
    Air Quality (OAQ) <https://oaq.notf.in>, satellite estimates of fine
    particulate matter (PM2.5) from the Atmospheric Composition Analysis
    Group at Washington University in St. Louis <https://www.satpm.org>,
    and fire detections from the NASA Fire Information for Resource
    Management System (FIRMS) <https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov> and
    from the fire images of the Indian National Satellite System (INSAT)
    that the Meteorological and Oceanographic Satellite Data Archival
    Centre (MOSDAC) <https://www.mosdac.gov.in> publishes. Calculates the 
    CPCB National Air Quality Index and the mean PM2.5 in an area.
